{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter Quizverse \u2013 a relaxed and clever quiz game that tests your knowledge in a fun way!</strong> <br>Whether you're a logic fan, science enthusiast or just curious, Quizverse challenges you with exciting questions from a wide range of topics and lets you try to beat your high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its varied but challenging questions, Quizverse offers the perfect blend of learning and entertainment \u2013 ideal for short breaks or long brainstorming sessions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different game modes:</strong> Test your knowledge in Free Play mode or under time pressure in 100-second mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 670 varied questions covering a wide range of topics:</strong> geography, history, sport, film &amp; music, technology, natural sciences and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing and challenging gameplay:</strong> designed for single players \u2013 no stress, just you and your knowledge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score attack &amp; high score tracking:</strong> Challenge yourself, improve your score and compare yourself with the high scores of others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam achievements:</strong> Unlock numerous achievements by achieving high scores, building up series and demonstrating your knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're playing for just a few minutes or diving into the high score marathon, Quizverse makes knowledge fun again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test your knowledge, discover new things and become the master of Quizverse!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4031450/cfe4a8e92d700238373606d47e7b920b106abc7